{
  "name": "Weekly broken-link report to Google Sheets (Apify Broken Link Checker)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4a78e42c-a894-43b1-ad36-d72820db470c",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Weekly broken-link report to Google Sheets\n\n**Who it's for:** site owners, SEO consultants and agencies who want to catch 404s and dead links before visitors and search engines do.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Every Monday at 8:00 the schedule starts the run.\n2. **Run Broken Link Checker** crawls your site with the Broken Link Checker Actor on Apify (internal pages + external links) and returns the results.\n3. **Only broken links** keeps the broken-link rows and drops the per-site summary.\n4. **Append to Google Sheets** adds one row per broken link, so you get a weekly history.\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Apify account (free plan works). In **Run Broken Link Checker** create an *HTTP Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Replace `example.com` in the request body with your site(s).\n3. In **Append to Google Sheets** connect Google and pick a sheet whose first row is: site, brokenUrl, statusCode, error, isExternal, foundOnPage, anchorText, checkedAt.\n\n**Customize:** change `maxPagesPerSite`, set `checkExternalLinks` to false, or swap Sheets for Slack/email.\n\n**Cost:** paid per page on Apify, about $1.50 per 1,000 pages; `maxTotalChargeUsd=2` caps each run at $2."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cac13430-0be0-42de-8ee2-9eabae971fb7",
      "name": "Every Monday 8:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d37a31dd-e674-40f0-9fc8-cf6ff4af51d9",
      "name": "Run Broken Link Checker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/uianalize~broken-link-checker/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "maxTotalChargeUsd",
              "value": "2"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"startUrls\": [\"example.com\"],\n  \"maxPagesPerSite\": 100,\n  \"checkExternalLinks\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
